message: "If you use Stable-ASR in research, please cite the repository and the eventual platform paper."
title: "Stable-ASR: A Platform for Reproducible Real-Time ASR and Full-Duplex Turn-Taking Research"
version: "0.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-31"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stable-asr/stable-asr"
